# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: Required by the live AI agent chat demo on the homepage.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# The same key powers two equivalent backends (both call src/server/chatHandler.ts):
#   - netlify/functions/chat.mts (Netlify Functions)
#   - api/chat.ts (Vercel Edge Functions)
# The frontend always calls /api/chat — on Netlify a redirect in netlify.toml
# forwards it to the Netlify Function; on Vercel it's served natively.
#
# - Netlify: set this in Site settings > Environment variables.
# - Vercel: set this in Project settings > Environment Variables.
# - Local dev: copy this file to .env and fill in your key, then run `netlify dev`
#   (requires the Netlify CLI) so the function and the Vite app run together.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="your-anthropic-api-key"
